{"4592480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crownbreak", "steam_appid": 4592480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4801760], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crownbreak</strong> is a medieval strategy game that combines base management, territorial conquest, and tactical battles, where every victory strengthens your army and every mistake can lead to defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR ARMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a modest base and turn it into a true fortress.<br>Upgrade your buildings to unlock new troops and enhance your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit, equip, and prepare for war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER ENEMY CASTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack nearby strongholds to gain gold and expand your power.<br>Each castle has its own difficulty level — choose your targets wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory makes you stronger. Defeat costs you everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEPLOY YOUR STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, organize your army:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged archers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solid frontline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flanking attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your formation to the terrain and anticipate enemy movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good strategy makes all the difference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT DECISIVE BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face AI-controlled enemy armies on the battlefield.<br>Each fight is a total clash: eliminate all your enemies… or fall with your army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE LEGENDARY BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous dungeons and challenge powerful elemental guardians:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire Golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth Golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Golem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These creatures require careful preparation.<br>Without upgraded equipment, they are nearly impossible to defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WILL YOU BREAK THE CROWN?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the three golems are defeated… something awakens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient power.<br>A buried secret.<br>A crown to break.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crownbreak</strong> is a medieval strategy game that combines base management, territorial conquest, and tactical battles, where every victory strengthens your army and every mistake can lead to defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR ARMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a modest base and turn it into a true fortress.<br>Upgrade your buildings to unlock new troops and enhance your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit, equip, and prepare for war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER ENEMY CASTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack nearby strongholds to gain gold and expand your power.<br>Each castle has its own difficulty level — choose your targets wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory makes you stronger. Defeat costs you everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEPLOY YOUR STRATEGY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, organize your army:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged archers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solid frontline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flanking attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your formation to the terrain and anticipate enemy movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A good strategy makes all the difference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT DECISIVE BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face AI-controlled enemy armies on the battlefield.<br>Each fight is a total clash: eliminate all your enemies… or fall with your army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE LEGENDARY BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous dungeons and challenge powerful elemental guardians:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire Golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth Golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Golem</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These creatures require careful preparation.<br>Without upgraded equipment, they are nearly impossible to defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WILL YOU BREAK THE CROWN?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the three golems are defeated… something awakens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient power.<br>A buried secret.<br>A crown to break.</p>", "short_description": "Build your army, conquer castles, and dominate tactical battles. Earn gold, upgrade your gear, and defeat powerful elemental bosses.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592480/f2e8ee8f254e70015fe71a73d7719e90683e380f/header.jpg?t=1787617783", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592480/954e9645836066cd9fe2fac2c8b41d3eb5469c8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787617783", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592480/954e9645836066cd9fe2fac2c8b41d3eb5469c8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787617783", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and 